    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "ox and being fouled by Dembélé. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "Messi converted the resulting penalty at 23', pu"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "tting Argentina 1–0 ahead. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "[[seq:sb:3869685:s31]] [[ev:sb:3869685:771]]\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "France’s nearby response was stop-start: Giroud "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "won a foul, but Griezmann’s subsequent delivery "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "was incomplete; Romero cleared before Hernández "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "fouled Messi. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "There was no immediate breakthrough from that at"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "tack. "
    },
